# Blackout, a radiation upset, and a Safe Mode entry, replayed against the
# real DTN store, TMR voter and black box. Run with:
#   tpts scenario run docs/scenarios/blackout-and-upset.scn
#
# No occultation here, so the drain delivers the backlog. Change `link` to
# mars-surface to see the same backlog held behind the occultation instead.
link none

at 0      telemetry 4 48   # four bundles queued for Earth
at 600    blackout 2       # link forced down for two hours
at 700    telemetry 2 48   # two more, queued during the blackout
at 1800   seu 1 20         # bit 20 of core 1 flips; the voter should mask it
at 7200   safe-mode        # power-survival Safe Mode, recorded in the box
at 8000   drain            # blackout over: hand the backlog to the link
